\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Iso-VDA contour band over the experimental-design plane $(V, v)$ at the headline configuration $(N, d'_{\max }, f_0, h) = (4,\,2,\,0.5,\,\sqrt  {}\,)$, variant~A. Rows: cross-location correlation $\rho \in \{0,\, 0.2\}$ (top, independence; bottom, the decorrelation channel of Section~\ref {sec:model} at the Cohen--Maunsell~\cite  {CohenMaunsell2009} cortical anchor $r_{SC} \approx 0.2$). Columns: benefit/cost asymmetry $r\in \{0.3,\, 1,\, 3\}$. The vertical reference $V= 1/N= 0.25$ is the chance baseline; the $v= 1$ row is the value-blind reference where $\mathrm  {VDA}\equiv 0$ by construction. Filled contours are at $\mathrm  {VDA}\in \{0,\,0.001,\,0.005,\,0.01,\,0.025,\,0.05,\,0.1,\,0.15,\,0.2\}$ on a common scale. Substantial VDA is confined to a corner along low $V$ and high $v$ that flattens as $r$ rises.}}{14}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:iso-vda-contours}{{6}{14}{Iso-VDA contour band over the experimental-design plane $(\valid , \val )$ at the headline configuration $(\Nloc , \dprimemax , f_0, h) = (4,\,2,\,0.5,\,\sqrt {}\,)$, variant~A. Rows: cross-location correlation $\corr \in \{0,\, 0.2\}$ (top, independence; bottom, the decorrelation channel of Section~\ref {sec:model} at the Cohen--Maunsell~\cite {CohenMaunsell2009} cortical anchor $r_{SC} \approx 0.2$). Columns: benefit/cost asymmetry $\Rsens \in \{0.3,\, 1,\, 3\}$. The vertical reference $\valid = 1/\Nloc = 0.25$ is the chance baseline; the $\val = 1$ row is the value-blind reference where $\VDA \equiv 0$ by construction. Filled contours are at $\VDA \in \{0,\,0.001,\,0.005,\,0.01,\,0.025,\,0.05,\,0.1,\,0.15,\,0.2\}$ on a common scale. Substantial VDA is confined to a corner along low $\valid $ and high $\val $ that flattens as $\Rsens $ rises}{figure.6}{}}
